| `reference/niagara/NinjaLiveCore.json` | 10,483,649 | `49e4b4a326ad7bc87c788b9ddadf1118ced917e37b2d0069af09e4163d2ccc3b` |
| `ninja_live_core_analysis.tmp.json` | 2,540,664 | `7088d4e88206202c780d87625286c02d188ec74219fad36e4e28c830bf406edb` |
